{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smash those Blobs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your strategy skills and defend your Fuel Refinery against the hordes of Blobs threatening your chances of survival on Planet Snaxeka! Build Turrets, fuel your Spaceship and escape the underworld of Snaxeka! Are you ready to face the challenge? Blow \u2018em up!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you get</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TowerDefense BlobSmash is an amazing strategy and TowerDefense game that leverages multiple mechanics to put your strategy skills to the test.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the right turrets and defend your Fuel Refinery against different waves of Blobs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your money and fuel resources: Will you find the right balance?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosions, toxic clouds and Turret-Upgrades: Use abilities to supplement your strategy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game in a casual setting: Relax and take breaks by playing TD BlobSmash!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop strategies for 16+ Levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the endless mode and achieve the highest score possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun the game and compare your results with the community!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared for upcoming Updates!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594450?t=1750703432","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594450?t=1750703432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594450/1eb7c2a3e067c334acecdc90902c72bb922f40b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750703432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594450/1eb7c2a3e067c334acecdc90902c72bb922f40b7/capsule_1